- * -[NSConstantDictionary keyEnumerator] dereferencing 1, and it works with the count last. An array
- * with the count LAST then died in -[NSConstantArray objectAtIndex:] dereferencing 5, which is a
- * count being used as a pointer, so the array keeps the count first.
+ * iTerm2 carries 459 constant arrays and 42 constant dictionaries in __DATA_CONST, in the sections
