+ *   ARRAY, stride 0x18, three words:  isa, count, objects
+ *     word1 varies across instances (1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 28), word2 is always a pointer.
+ *
+ *   DICTIONARY, stride 0x28, FIVE words:  isa, options, count, keys, objects
